      "occurrences": [],
      "pattern": "Subagent Without Skills",
      "remediation": "Pass the subagent the Skills it needs by adding a skills entry to its own definition, naming the same sources the main agent is given where the subagent is meant to share them. Where the subagent is deliberately meant to run without Skills, say so beside the definition -- there is nothing at runtime that distinguishes the two.",
